{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 122, "line_no": 2, "text": "降下痢疾、痧子、天花、鸟鼠等灾难来危害祖王和庄稼，祖王表示什么都不怕，“决不跪拜", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 270, "w": 1548, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "降下痢疾、痧子、天花、鸟鼠等灾难来危害祖王和庄稼，祖王表示什么都不怕，“决不跪拜", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 270, "w": 1548, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 122, "line_no": 3, "text": "安王”。安王果然上天降下各种灾难，使祖王损失惨重。经过几次交锋，骄横凶暴的祖王", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 334, "w": 1548, "h": 62}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "安王”。安王果然上天降下各种灾难，使祖王损失惨重。经过几次交锋，骄横凶暴的祖王", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 334, "w": 1548, "h": 62}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 122, "line_no": 4, "text": "不得不认输，忙请乌鹊作使者，多次上天向安王求和，答应安王提出的财产要求，最后安", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 402, "w": 1548, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "不得不认输，忙请乌鹊作使者，多次上天向安王求和，答应安王提出的财产要求，最后安", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 402, "w": 1548, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 122, "line_no": 5, "text": "王同意和解。从此安王“管上方”，祖王“管下方”，天下太平。", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 463, "w": 1061, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "王同意和解。从此安王“管上方”，祖王“管下方”，天下太平。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 463, "w": 1061, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 122, "line_no": 6, "text": "《穆播董》说：", "bbox_px": {"x": 398, "y": 534, "w": 233, "h": 46}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "《穆播董》说：", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 398, "y": 534, "w": 233, "h": 46}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 122, "line_no": 7, "text": "请安王管田，", "bbox_px": {"x": 402, "y": 599, "w": 225, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "请安王管田，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 402, "y": 599, "w": 225, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 122, "line_no": 8, "text": "请安王管印。", "bbox_px": {"x": 402, "y": 664, "w": 229, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "请安王管印。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 402, "y": 664, "w": 229, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 122, "line_no": 9, "text": "安王管上方，", "bbox_px": {"x": 402, "y": 796, "w": 226, "h": 50}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "安王管上方，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 402, "y": 796, "w": 226, "h": 50}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 122, "line_no": 10, "text": "祖王管下方。", "bbox_px": {"x": 402, "y": 860, "w": 230, "h": 51}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "祖王管下方。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 402, "y": 860, "w": 230, "h": 51}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 122, "line_no": 11, "text": "下方每年要交租，", "bbox_px": {"x": 402, "y": 925, "w": 310, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "下方每年要交租，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 402, "y": 925, "w": 310, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
